      "title": "File:Aoraki Mount Cook. New Zealand. (15492655292).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/Aoraki_Mount_Cook._New_Zealand._%2815492655292%29.jpg",
